%SIXMD 1
# @?RAND - GENERATE 36-BIT PSEUDORANDOM WORDS

## DESCRIPTION

GENERATES COUNT OCTAL WORDS WITH A LINEAR CONGRUENTIAL GENERATOR. DEFAULT SEED IS DERIVED FROM TIME36.

USAGE IS 'RAND [SEED [COUNT]]'.

THIS COMMAND IS IMPLEMENTED ENTIRELY IN PDP-6 ASSEMBLER AND IS PART OF THE
OPTIONAL ASMUTILS PACKAGE. IT IS INSTALLED IN /OPTION/BASE/EXEC.

## @?FILES

### @?/OPTION/BASE/EXEC/RAND
OPTIONAL EXECUTABLE.

### @?/OPTION/BASE/SOURCE/ASMUTILS/RAND.S
ASSEMBLER SOURCE.

